```sql
--Description: 4) Demonstrate a spatial join between hurricane points (constructed on-the-fly from latitude /
--longitude) and ZIP polygons.  Uses ST_WITHIN to verify that the expression works.  The geometry column in
--the ZIP table is assumed to be “SHAPE_GEOMETRY”; adjust if inspection shows a different name.
SELECT 
       h."sid",
       h."name"              AS "storm_name",
       z."zip_code",
       z."city",
       z."state"
